WEBVTT

01:26.040 --> 01:31.580
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.560
[Episode 17: Ingenious Tricks]

01:45.220 --> 01:46.246
Menglan.

01:46.270 --> 01:47.486
Try this.

01:47.510 --> 01:48.960
I'm sure you'll like it.

01:54.510 --> 01:56.150
I wondered why Mr. Yun

01:56.800 --> 01:59.009
chose to play word guessing in the second round.

02:00.070 --> 02:03.470
It turned out that he had made a perfect plan.

02:05.560 --> 02:07.006
Indeed.

02:07.030 --> 02:09.086
Yun adopted a risky way this time.

02:09.110 --> 02:10.789
He had no choice.

02:11.150 --> 02:14.500
He knows Tang Xiao got people inside Liansheng House.

02:14.820 --> 02:16.706
Even if we use our own things,

02:16.730 --> 02:18.620
it's hard to make sure nothing would go wrong.

02:21.590 --> 02:26.160
I hired the new recruits.

02:28.880 --> 02:29.966
Don't worry.

02:29.990 --> 02:31.960
Yun is very sensible.

02:32.100 --> 02:33.550
He won't blame you.

02:42.950 --> 02:44.356
Mr. Su.

02:44.380 --> 02:45.506
Tianhu.

02:45.530 --> 02:47.116
You've worked hard today.

02:47.140 --> 02:48.596
But in the next three days,

02:48.620 --> 02:50.190
we still can't slack off.

02:50.310 --> 02:52.370
We are competing with Tang's Gambling House on revenues.

02:52.700 --> 02:54.466
Yun's fate

02:54.490 --> 02:56.109
will be in your hands.

02:57.820 --> 02:59.246
I understand.

02:59.270 --> 03:01.126
You must be tired after a day's work.

03:01.150 --> 03:02.600
I'll go back now.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.570
Go to bed early.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.600
Tianhu.

03:15.310 --> 03:17.166
Sleep here tonight.

03:17.190 --> 03:20.140
We haven't had a heart-to-heart for a long time.

03:21.520 --> 03:22.586
Miss,

03:22.610 --> 03:24.366
I'm tired today.

03:24.390 --> 03:26.470
I want to go back and go to rest early.

03:33.410 --> 03:35.970
[Liansheng House]

04:11.870 --> 04:14.500
Your little master is really capable.

04:15.340 --> 04:16.590
I planned to defeat him

04:16.590 --> 04:18.656
at one stroke.

04:18.680 --> 04:22.296
But he somehow

04:22.320 --> 04:24.066
managed to settle the score.

04:24.090 --> 04:27.690
Consider yourself lucky as you managed to

04:27.770 --> 04:29.566
make it out of Yun Xiang's hands.

04:29.590 --> 04:31.790
Talk more while you can.

04:32.230 --> 04:34.966
In a few days, when he becomes my servant,

04:34.990 --> 04:38.310
I'll let him see how you'll die a terrible death.

04:41.990 --> 04:44.576
Shu Yanan

04:44.600 --> 04:46.689
is getting more aggressive.

04:47.360 --> 04:51.340
She broke into my off-limits and killed my servant.

04:51.590 --> 04:53.686
I'm really interested in her.

04:53.710 --> 04:55.160
Bastard.

04:55.230 --> 04:57.096
You'd better think about

04:57.120 --> 05:00.370
how to beg Yun Xiang to kill you in a decent way.

05:09.530 --> 05:10.980
Tianhu.

05:13.230 --> 05:14.056
You're here.

05:14.080 --> 05:14.640
Master.

05:14.660 --> 05:16.540
Come on. Sit down.

05:23.820 --> 05:26.670
Tell me. What happened today?

05:27.730 --> 05:29.096
Master,

05:29.120 --> 05:30.230
I have figured it out.

05:30.230 --> 05:31.680
Tianhu.

05:32.120 --> 05:33.346
When did you switch to his side?

05:33.370 --> 05:35.040
It's none of your business.

06:19.200 --> 06:21.480
There's no outsider now. Tell me.

06:21.830 --> 06:24.026
Miss Ke did change the equipment

06:24.050 --> 06:25.660
according to your order.

06:26.520 --> 06:28.810
But Yun Xiang saw that coming.

06:29.290 --> 06:30.970
Therefore, he proposed to play word guessing.

06:31.020 --> 06:32.500
In this way,

06:32.940 --> 06:35.360
he can prevent you from cheating.

06:36.100 --> 06:39.189
It's reasonable for him to see that coming.

06:39.710 --> 06:41.916
But how could he cheat in word guessing?

06:41.940 --> 06:44.200
With the help of iron filings and magnetic powder.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.966
The inkstick was specially made.

06:45.990 --> 06:47.516
There was magnetic powder in the compartment.

06:47.540 --> 06:49.676
When Mr. Su opened it,

06:49.700 --> 06:51.360
he could see the word

06:51.940 --> 06:53.580
you had written easily.

07:05.230 --> 07:07.650
That is a fresh approach.

07:08.290 --> 07:09.880
But...

07:12.550 --> 07:14.790
I remember you brought the paper, inkstick,

07:14.790 --> 07:17.310
ink brush, and inkstone in person.

07:17.480 --> 07:20.526
They were labeled "used in accounting office".

07:20.550 --> 07:22.430
I only found out later that

07:22.620 --> 07:25.146
in order to make sure nothing would go wrong,

07:25.170 --> 07:27.620
Yun Xiang changed all the inkstones in Liansheng House.

07:27.860 --> 07:29.156
Besides,

07:29.180 --> 07:31.146
if you sent someone to buy one,

07:31.170 --> 07:34.286
you would get the same result.

07:34.310 --> 07:36.150
Yun Xiang swapped all the inkstones nearby for ones with iron filings.

07:40.090 --> 07:42.970
That's impressive.

07:43.410 --> 07:44.860
Tianhu.

07:45.970 --> 07:47.326
Yes.

07:47.350 --> 07:49.910
When you go back,

07:50.430 --> 07:53.670
if anything happens,

07:54.150 --> 07:55.046
report it to me immediately.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.476
Yes, Master.

07:56.500 --> 07:57.950
Tianhu.

08:05.620 --> 08:09.706
Even if you don't have a close tie with Yun Xiang,

08:09.730 --> 08:11.326
you shouldn't betray Ke Menglan.

08:11.350 --> 08:14.310
She is like a sister to you.

08:14.480 --> 08:16.600
Ke Menglan...

08:20.990 --> 08:22.986
Who do you think

08:23.010 --> 08:26.860
Ke Menglan works for now?

08:29.230 --> 08:30.680
Impossible.

08:31.080 --> 08:33.880
Let me tell you a secret.

08:34.790 --> 08:36.620
Ke Menglan

08:36.660 --> 08:38.516
is actually the only traitor

08:38.540 --> 08:41.126
among you guys.

08:41.150 --> 08:43.106
She, Tian Hu.

08:43.130 --> 08:44.826
She's not a traitor.

08:44.850 --> 08:48.166
She lost her mind because I poisoned her with Heart Devouring Powder.

08:48.190 --> 08:51.236
She has to obey my order even if I ask her to die.

08:51.260 --> 08:52.710
Bastard!

08:53.390 --> 08:55.566
I'll kill you sooner or later.

08:55.590 --> 08:57.450
You can't intimidate me with that.

08:57.930 --> 08:59.806
Tianhu. He abused me.

08:59.830 --> 09:01.280
Slap him for me.

09:08.300 --> 09:09.750
Tianhu.

09:10.130 --> 09:11.346
Master.

09:11.370 --> 09:13.160
Slap him.

09:27.390 --> 09:31.090
I like Jin.

09:32.750 --> 09:35.180
I can't hurt him.

09:42.390 --> 09:43.860
Let her go!

09:44.350 --> 09:46.600
The poison is still effective.

09:47.430 --> 09:49.320
This is true love.

09:50.870 --> 09:52.686
What kind of feelings...

09:52.710 --> 09:53.750
What kind of feelings

09:53.750 --> 09:56.230
can suppress the Heart Devouring Powder?

09:57.470 --> 10:00.350
Master, you are always my master.

10:00.820 --> 10:02.270
But...

10:02.860 --> 10:05.140
But I like Jin.

10:12.450 --> 10:13.900
Zhong,

10:14.540 --> 10:16.710
we've seen many interesting things.

10:17.590 --> 10:20.520
Have you seen a live sex show?

10:21.520 --> 10:22.606
Asshole!

10:22.630 --> 10:24.470
Come at me if you dare.

10:25.720 --> 10:27.590
I'd like to see

10:28.230 --> 10:30.686
-Tang Xiao. -whether the fearless

10:30.710 --> 10:33.180
Jin Biao, "Ten Taels of Gold",

10:33.700 --> 10:35.326
Tang Xiao! Tang Xiao!

10:35.350 --> 10:36.110
Tang Xiao. Tang Xiao.

10:36.110 --> 10:37.560
Tang Xiao!

10:38.920 --> 10:39.366
Tang Xiao!

10:39.390 --> 10:40.590
feels afraid of..

10:40.590 --> 10:41.796
Stop!

10:41.820 --> 10:43.270
this!

10:49.020 --> 10:51.390
Tianhu. Tianhu.

10:56.470 --> 10:57.920
Tianhu.

10:58.980 --> 11:00.430
Tianhu!

11:01.470 --> 11:03.980
Tianhu, don't get any closer.

11:05.720 --> 11:07.170
Tianhu!

11:09.410 --> 11:10.860
Tianhu.

11:15.350 --> 11:17.560
I like you.

11:19.700 --> 11:22.090
I'm willing to do anything.

11:23.060 --> 11:25.346
Tianhu, you still remember me.

11:25.370 --> 11:27.036
It means you haven't lost your mind completely.

11:27.060 --> 11:28.510
Come to your senses.

11:28.660 --> 11:31.170
I'm willing to do anything.

11:35.200 --> 11:37.066
Ten Taels of Gold.

11:37.090 --> 11:40.280
Are you a man?

11:41.450 --> 11:42.900
Tang Xiao,

11:43.550 --> 11:48.500
I must be the one who kills you.

12:27.940 --> 12:33.320
The weather is dry. Beware of fire.

12:35.270 --> 12:36.720
Number one.

12:37.670 --> 12:39.120
Number two.

12:39.710 --> 12:41.160
Number three.

12:42.990 --> 12:44.246
In the next three days,

12:44.270 --> 12:45.686
open a pouch a day

12:45.710 --> 12:47.160
and act according to plan.

12:47.390 --> 12:49.770
With these three pouches,

12:49.990 --> 12:51.650
nothing would go wrong.

12:52.120 --> 12:53.570
All right, I'm leaving.

12:55.760 --> 12:58.280
Are you trying to create a diversion or...

12:59.540 --> 13:01.916
It's impossible for Liansheng House

13:01.940 --> 13:03.466
to make more revenues than Tang's Gambling House.

13:03.490 --> 13:04.356
But you...

13:04.380 --> 13:05.506
Let's stop there.

13:05.530 --> 13:07.570
Can you have some confidence in me?

13:08.190 --> 13:10.190
I'll lose if you keep saying that.

13:12.100 --> 13:13.550
Trust me.

13:14.710 --> 13:16.420
Okay, I trust you.

13:17.060 --> 13:18.700
But with these...

13:18.860 --> 13:20.456
By the way,

13:20.480 --> 13:23.006
remember to open these pouches

13:23.030 --> 13:24.640
in front of Su Mingyu and Ke Menglan.

13:26.700 --> 13:29.406
You know Ke Menglan is controlled by Tang Xiao.

13:29.430 --> 13:31.180
You really want to use her?

13:32.380 --> 13:34.290
We've discussed this matter.

13:34.430 --> 13:36.230
Don't let emotions cloud your judgment.

13:37.470 --> 13:38.756
Don't worry.

13:38.780 --> 13:41.430
I have a very thorough plan.

13:42.800 --> 13:44.250
Trust me.

13:48.350 --> 13:49.046
By the way,

13:49.070 --> 13:50.550
you have to teach me

13:50.720 --> 13:52.056
how to get down from here

13:52.080 --> 13:53.710
without getting hurt.

13:54.260 --> 13:55.770
Why don't you take the front door?

13:56.100 --> 13:57.776
If others know

13:57.800 --> 13:59.266
I leave Liansheng House alone,

13:59.290 --> 14:01.536
it will undermine my plan.

14:01.560 --> 14:03.516
I have to make sure nothing goes wrong.

14:03.540 --> 14:05.276
How about this? Give me a demonstration.

14:05.300 --> 14:06.910
I can imitate you.

14:10.590 --> 14:12.130
I can do it.

14:12.940 --> 14:14.390
Trust me.

14:14.820 --> 14:16.270
Come on.

14:25.870 --> 14:27.820
I didn't see anything.

14:31.300 --> 14:33.326
Just jump. What are you waiting for?

14:33.350 --> 14:35.286
Even if you fall to the ground, you just need to rest for a few days.

14:35.310 --> 14:36.760
I believe in you.

14:58.950 --> 15:00.786
Why are you standing so far away?

15:00.810 --> 15:02.266
Catch me.

15:02.290 --> 15:04.080
Don't even think about it.

15:05.840 --> 15:07.290
I'm gonna jump.

15:37.900 --> 15:40.990
You have a small figure but you're strong.

15:49.270 --> 15:54.100
The weather is dry. Beware of fire.

15:56.980 --> 15:58.790
Miss, are you alright?

16:04.000 --> 16:05.450
Good.

16:08.680 --> 16:14.120
The weather is dry. Beware of fire.

16:16.030 --> 16:17.116
All right, go back now.

16:17.140 --> 16:18.590
I'm leaving.

16:18.890 --> 16:20.460
Are you going to Guanghui Bank?

16:21.110 --> 16:22.560
You're quite smart.

16:23.730 --> 16:25.490
What? What do you mean?

16:25.520 --> 16:27.286
Mr. Mo will definitely say something.

16:27.310 --> 16:28.760
You'll know when you get there.

16:29.690 --> 16:30.716
Oh,

16:30.740 --> 16:31.806
about Jin.

16:31.830 --> 16:33.716
I've sent shadowmen to keep an eye on him.

16:33.740 --> 16:36.430
They are waiting for the right moment to rescue him.

16:38.510 --> 16:40.240
You're quite strong.

16:48.700 --> 16:50.916
Jin Biao is still in the dungeon of Tang's Residence.

16:50.940 --> 16:52.636
In addition, Ke Menglan and Tianhu

16:52.660 --> 16:54.036
entered Tang's Residence.

16:54.060 --> 16:55.756
But Ke Menglan stopped outside the courtyard

16:55.780 --> 16:57.196
while Tianhu went into Tang Xiao's room.

16:57.220 --> 16:58.740
She was there for about an hour.

16:58.800 --> 17:00.366
Go back and keep watching.

17:00.390 --> 17:01.840
Yes.

17:04.110 --> 17:06.040
How many people in Liansheng House

17:06.070 --> 17:08.020
can you trust now?

17:08.200 --> 17:10.960
I knew about Miss Ke.

17:11.509 --> 17:14.776
But I didn't expect Tianhu to be controlled by Tang Xiao as well.

17:14.800 --> 17:16.526
Now the people who are running Liansheng House

17:16.550 --> 17:17.985
are all Tang Xiao's people.

17:18.009 --> 17:20.139
But you chose to compete with him.

17:20.300 --> 17:21.980
What chance is there of you winning?

17:22.450 --> 17:25.220
What's the point of winning all the time?

17:25.360 --> 17:27.050
What if I want to lose?

17:28.060 --> 17:29.580
I'm all ears.

17:31.630 --> 17:34.880
It's boring to know the answer now.

17:35.110 --> 17:36.590
Don't worry, Mr. Mo.

17:36.640 --> 17:37.886
I can guarantee Guanghui Bank

17:37.910 --> 17:40.550
to be the biggest beneficiary of this competition.

17:42.260 --> 17:43.820
You seem pretty sure about it.

17:46.020 --> 17:48.376
Actually, the betrayal of these people

17:48.400 --> 17:50.350
is not important.

17:50.580 --> 17:53.310
It's very likely you'll turn Tang Xiao's trick against him.

17:53.870 --> 17:57.526
But if someone who's very close to you

17:57.550 --> 17:59.196
turns against you,

17:59.220 --> 18:02.390
you'll be doomed.

18:03.670 --> 18:05.436
That girl was poisoned by Drunken Dragon.

18:05.460 --> 18:07.286
But she said she had a secret medicine

18:07.310 --> 18:08.896
that could delay the poison from taking effect.

18:08.920 --> 18:11.640
That's how she escaped from the dungeon of Tang's Residence.

18:18.030 --> 18:19.660
She is good at using poison.

18:19.950 --> 18:21.516
Of course, she is good at detoxifying as well.

18:21.540 --> 18:24.220
That's the poison from Lingyuan Sect.

18:26.690 --> 18:29.926
You and I have long suspected Tang Xiao colludes with Lingyuan Sect.

18:29.950 --> 18:32.486
It's not surprising that he uses the Dragon series poison well.

18:32.510 --> 18:34.046
You're burying the lede.

18:34.070 --> 18:36.020
You know I'm not talking about Tang Xiao.

18:36.520 --> 18:38.150
Tell me the truth.

18:38.560 --> 18:40.246
The first time I took you to see Master, we were tailed.

18:40.270 --> 18:42.086
Kang Qiao got poisoned with Dragon series poison

18:42.110 --> 18:45.590
in a fight with a mystery person.

18:45.790 --> 18:48.560
Is that person her?

18:55.700 --> 18:58.860
Why do you think it was Miss Shu?

18:58.990 --> 19:00.540
It's just my hunch.

19:02.840 --> 19:04.290
That's right.

19:05.740 --> 19:10.200
Miss Shu has had a rough life.

19:11.390 --> 19:13.260
She had many adventures while traveling.

19:14.810 --> 19:16.476
When I first met her,

19:16.500 --> 19:17.886
I knew she was proficient in the Dragon series poison.

19:17.910 --> 19:19.790
I tried many times to test her out.

19:19.840 --> 19:22.226
But I didn't see anything wrong.

19:22.250 --> 19:24.130
Even if you don't believe her,

19:24.180 --> 19:25.660
you should trust me.

19:27.920 --> 19:29.556
I just want to remind you.

19:29.580 --> 19:31.620
You don't have to explain so much.

19:32.110 --> 19:35.260
But just now, when I asked

19:35.370 --> 19:38.756
what if the person closest to you betrays you,

19:38.780 --> 19:41.100
she's the one you thought of first,

19:41.500 --> 19:42.950
right?

19:53.310 --> 19:55.506
Last time, at Liansheng House,

19:55.530 --> 19:57.650
you said there was something we couldn't talk about there.

19:58.260 --> 19:59.710
What is it?

20:00.290 --> 20:04.126
From now on, keep me informed

20:04.150 --> 20:06.710
of everything Yun Xiang does.

20:09.650 --> 20:11.890
I have so many things to tell you.

20:11.960 --> 20:13.440
It's too late today.

20:13.710 --> 20:15.900
I'm sleepy. I'm going to bed.

20:23.840 --> 20:30.790
[Liansheng House]

20:31.260 --> 20:33.300
Yun Xiang gave me three pouches.

20:33.420 --> 20:35.630
One pouch a day. We need to act according to the plan inside.

20:36.270 --> 20:37.720
Pouches?

20:38.590 --> 20:39.806
What's wrong with Yun?

20:39.830 --> 20:41.326
Why can't he arrange this himself?

20:41.350 --> 20:42.800
I don't know.

20:43.110 --> 20:45.710
He would stay in his room every day and wouldn't see anyone.

20:45.750 --> 20:48.590
He asked me to send food and daily necessities to his room.

20:54.150 --> 20:55.600
Why are you smiling?

20:56.370 --> 20:58.890
I smiled because you're blinded by love.

20:58.960 --> 21:00.376
In the past,

21:00.400 --> 21:02.410
you wouldn't do such a thing.

21:04.010 --> 21:05.566
He's always playing tricks.

21:05.590 --> 21:07.110
I don't want to ask about details.

21:07.890 --> 21:09.370
That being said,

21:10.280 --> 21:11.606
since I met Yun,

21:11.630 --> 21:13.006
he has never failed.

21:13.030 --> 21:15.076
I admire him very much.

21:15.100 --> 21:18.390
It's natural that you like him.

21:18.490 --> 21:19.666
Like him?

21:19.690 --> 21:21.950
I know you've been working hard lately.

21:22.070 --> 21:24.166
This is the second day since Liansheng House's opening.

21:24.190 --> 21:27.590
-Everyone, pull yourselves together. -This is the most important thing now.

21:32.050 --> 21:33.856
You're not only blinded by love.

21:33.880 --> 21:36.250
Your soul is stolen by her.

21:39.240 --> 21:40.690
Manager Ke.

21:45.000 --> 21:47.300
That's it. Dismiss.

21:47.430 --> 21:48.880
Yes.

21:56.310 --> 21:59.660
[10% Rebate for Promotion]

22:04.510 --> 22:05.960
What is this?

22:06.280 --> 22:07.106
Mr. Su.

22:07.130 --> 22:09.770
Mr. Su. Mr. Su.

22:09.760 --> 22:14.600
[10% Rebate for Promotion]

22:11.930 --> 22:15.416
10% rebate for promotion?

22:15.440 --> 22:16.566
Mr. Su,

22:16.590 --> 22:18.406
the highest rebate offered

22:18.430 --> 22:20.536
by gambling houses in Nandu is 1%.

22:20.560 --> 22:22.246
You can offer 10%?

22:22.270 --> 22:23.916
You must have heard

22:23.940 --> 22:26.026
we are competing with Tang's Gambling House

22:26.050 --> 22:27.876
on revenues.

22:27.900 --> 22:29.996
So in order to attract more customers,

22:30.020 --> 22:31.496
we decided to offer a 10% rebate,

22:31.520 --> 22:33.926
but only for three days.

22:33.950 --> 22:35.670
Just three days?

22:35.950 --> 22:36.850
Then we have to hurry up.

22:36.870 --> 22:37.826
What are we waiting for?

22:37.850 --> 22:38.696
Let's go.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.310
Let's go.

22:40.580 --> 22:42.030
Hurry up.

22:42.070 --> 22:44.026
I'm going to win all your money.

22:44.050 --> 22:45.906
Is he insulting me?

22:45.930 --> 22:47.176
He wants to beat me

22:47.200 --> 22:49.320
with a 10% rebate?

22:49.350 --> 22:50.950
Maybe...

22:52.690 --> 22:54.170
Maybe he has a backup plan?

22:55.270 --> 22:58.660
Or maybe he's diverting our attention.

22:59.020 --> 23:01.580
Anyway, no matter what Yun Xiang does,

23:02.780 --> 23:05.910
go and tell our dealers

23:06.460 --> 23:07.910
to act according to the plan.

23:08.140 --> 23:09.590
Got it.

23:14.750 --> 23:16.460
I'm going to open it.

23:19.140 --> 23:20.590
Open.

23:31.470 --> 23:33.006
We've had three draws in such a short time.

23:33.030 --> 23:34.576
I quit. You guys are cheating.

23:34.600 --> 23:36.680
Sir, how could you say that?

23:36.980 --> 23:38.260
Let's continue.

23:38.280 --> 23:40.100
Ignore him. Let's continue.

23:48.860 --> 23:50.310
Menglan.

24:04.700 --> 24:07.940
I lost seven to eight customers in an hour.

24:09.020 --> 24:10.166
I know.

24:10.190 --> 24:12.146
But there's nothing I can do.

24:12.170 --> 24:13.800
There are a few dealers

24:14.030 --> 24:16.750
who are planted here by Tang Xiao.

24:22.440 --> 24:24.116
They made customers lose in a row

24:24.140 --> 24:26.070
and drove them away in this way.

24:27.180 --> 24:28.566
Menglan.

24:28.590 --> 24:30.190
You are experienced.

24:30.510 --> 24:32.220
You can see what they are trying to do.

24:35.760 --> 24:38.080
But we are really short of hands now.

24:38.120 --> 24:40.966
I don't have enough people to replace them.

24:40.990 --> 24:42.690
What if we offer a higher rebate?

24:43.890 --> 24:45.480
We'll lose money then.

24:47.130 --> 24:50.330
Tang Xiao and Yun Xiang are competing on revenues.

24:50.480 --> 24:53.410
It's not about net profit.

24:55.950 --> 24:57.800
Why are you confused?

25:00.980 --> 25:02.810
Help me.

25:03.780 --> 25:04.766
Mr. Su and I know little

25:04.790 --> 25:07.046
about running the gambling house.

25:07.070 --> 25:08.936
I can only rely on you now.

25:08.960 --> 25:11.450
I'm afraid Yun Xiang has underestimated his rival.

25:11.950 --> 25:13.740
By convention,

25:14.050 --> 25:16.216
the banker wins in a draw.

25:16.240 --> 25:18.360
We can change the rule for these three days.

25:18.600 --> 25:20.660
Players are considered winners in a draw.

25:20.810 --> 25:22.406
This is more attractive to players

25:22.430 --> 25:24.720
than the 10% rebate.

25:25.990 --> 25:27.820
I knew you could find a way.

25:31.150 --> 25:33.700
This is not a long-term solution.

25:34.350 --> 25:36.286
As long as these dealers are here,

25:36.310 --> 25:38.270
they'll continue to play tricks.

25:40.260 --> 25:41.750
Leave it to me.

25:44.070 --> 25:45.590
Thank you, Menglan.

25:45.870 --> 25:47.320
I'm glad you're here.

25:54.590 --> 25:56.460
I'll deal with them.

26:05.870 --> 26:07.320
Everyone,

26:07.490 --> 26:10.030
are you having a good time?

26:10.150 --> 26:11.486
If you want more fun,

26:11.510 --> 26:13.510
we can change the rules.

26:13.930 --> 26:16.350
In these three days,

26:16.720 --> 26:19.976
in a draw, players take all.

26:20.000 --> 26:22.846
Great! Nice!

26:22.870 --> 26:24.406
Someone just said

26:24.430 --> 26:26.930
some of our dealers are cheating.

26:27.000 --> 26:29.126
I want you to do me a favor.

26:29.150 --> 26:32.190
Please tell me

26:32.260 --> 26:33.696
if you find any dealer who's playing tricks.

26:33.720 --> 26:37.360
You'll be rewarded with ten taels of gold.

26:37.710 --> 26:39.390
Ten taels! Ten taels!

26:39.910 --> 26:42.500
For a dealer, reputation is everything.

26:42.670 --> 26:45.230
If you want to break the rules of Liansheng House,

26:46.130 --> 26:48.530
you can have a try.

27:03.050 --> 27:05.050
Sir, please come in.

27:09.700 --> 27:11.300
Mr. Su, you are back.

27:14.350 --> 27:16.446
It's after curfew now.

27:16.470 --> 27:17.366
Why haven't we closed yet?

27:17.390 --> 27:18.366
You don't know?

27:18.390 --> 27:19.636
We just got permission

27:19.660 --> 27:21.606
to stay open overnight these three days.

27:21.630 --> 27:23.270
Really? That's nice.

27:23.430 --> 27:24.686
Go.

27:24.710 --> 27:26.316
Mr. Qian was here this afternoon.

27:26.340 --> 27:29.146
Chairman Su asked him to use connections in the government to make an exception for us,

27:29.170 --> 27:32.290
allowing us to stay open overnight for three days.

27:33.110 --> 27:35.046
My sister said she would prepare a gift for our opening ceremony.

27:35.070 --> 27:36.496
I didn't expect it to be so unique.

27:36.520 --> 27:38.200
This came in handy.

27:38.900 --> 27:41.200
I'd like to thank the Su family on behalf of Yun Xiang.

27:41.870 --> 27:43.496
Yun's concerns are my concerns.

27:43.520 --> 27:45.520
You don't need to say thank you.

27:46.870 --> 27:48.320
Have you found out how much

27:49.950 --> 27:52.686
Tang's Gambling House has earned today?

27:52.710 --> 27:54.160
Of course.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.806
We should get Menglan.

27:55.830 --> 27:57.280
She's good at calculating.

28:04.250 --> 28:05.820
Up to today,

28:06.630 --> 28:09.486
we have earned 1,328 taels and 7 cents.

28:09.510 --> 28:10.960
- So little?
- That much?

28:12.790 --> 28:14.750
How much has Tang's Gambling House earned?

28:15.110 --> 28:16.790
Over 2,900 taels.

28:19.990 --> 28:21.860
How did they do that?

28:22.310 --> 28:25.550
Tang Xiao has more than ten gambling houses.

28:25.910 --> 28:27.676
Customers of those gambling houses

28:27.700 --> 28:29.126
got free chips today.

28:29.150 --> 28:31.370
The chips can only be used in Tang's Gambling House.

28:32.280 --> 28:35.960
In this way, more people went to Tang's Gambling House.

28:38.550 --> 28:40.520
But even without the free chips,

28:41.920 --> 28:44.340
the daily revenue of Tang's Gambling House

28:44.450 --> 28:46.490
is about 1,000 taels.

28:47.250 --> 28:48.856
Even if we stay open all night,

28:48.880 --> 28:50.340
at most, we can earn as much as they do.

28:53.870 --> 28:55.286
Is there any other way?

28:55.310 --> 28:57.510
We don't have to follow Tang Xiao's rules.

28:58.750 --> 29:00.256
What do you think?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.406
The so-called revenue

29:01.430 --> 29:03.250
is actually just a few pages of the ledger.

29:03.790 --> 29:06.470
But the government stipulates that

29:06.590 --> 29:09.516
all gambling houses need to record their revenues by real names.

29:09.540 --> 29:11.696
It's very easy

29:11.720 --> 29:12.706
to find any falsification.

29:12.730 --> 29:13.966
That's right.

29:13.990 --> 29:15.990
Also, in this competition,

29:16.030 --> 29:18.126
the ledgers of Liansheng House

29:18.150 --> 29:19.710
and Tang's Gambling House must be made public.

29:19.740 --> 29:21.926
Many eyes are watching us now.

29:21.950 --> 29:23.550
Lots of people are plotting against us.

29:24.070 --> 29:26.276
If they find out that we tamper with the ledger,

29:26.300 --> 29:28.070
we'll lose this round.

29:38.860 --> 29:40.310
Miss Shu.

29:41.250 --> 29:43.170
The second day is coming.

29:44.070 --> 29:45.520
Yes.

29:53.300 --> 29:55.280
Mr. Su.

29:57.000 --> 30:02.950
[If Liansheng House wins, the bet-to-payout ratio will be 1:7.]

29:57.000 --> 30:03.200
[If Tang's Gambling House wins, the bet-to-payout ratio will be 1:2.]

29:57.340 --> 29:59.916
If Liansheng House wins, the bet-to-payout ratio will be 1:7.

29:59.940 --> 30:02.810
If Tang's Gambling House wins, the bet-to-payout ratio will be 1:2.

30:03.310 --> 30:04.206
Mr. Su,

30:04.230 --> 30:05.356
what is this?

30:05.380 --> 30:06.916
Liansheng House and Tang's Gambling House

30:06.940 --> 30:08.436
are competing on revenues.

30:08.460 --> 30:10.196
I believe you all know that.

30:10.220 --> 30:11.956
Don't you want to bet on

30:11.980 --> 30:13.576
who will win in the end?

30:13.600 --> 30:16.470
But the bet-to-payout ratio of 1:7 is too high.

30:16.950 --> 30:18.730
You are all savvy players.

30:18.830 --> 30:21.326
I believe you can tell that if we rely on our usual operations only,

30:21.350 --> 30:24.190
it will be hard for us to beat Tang's Gambling House.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.436
The probability of winning is low

30:25.460 --> 30:27.520
and of course, the payout rate is high.

30:28.260 --> 30:31.966
But no matter how high the payout rate is,

30:31.990 --> 30:33.366
if Liansheng House can't win, we can't earn the money.

30:33.390 --> 30:34.246
This is tricky.

30:34.270 --> 30:34.986
Yeah.

30:35.010 --> 30:37.116
But no matter which party you bet on,

30:37.140 --> 30:39.230
your bets are part of our revenues.

30:39.310 --> 30:41.710
I'd like to thank you in advance.

30:42.840 --> 30:45.090
If that's the case,

30:45.150 --> 30:47.366
the more we bet, the more revenue you can make.

30:47.390 --> 30:49.120
Then there is a greater chance of winning.

30:49.290 --> 30:50.850
Let's go.

30:55.110 --> 30:56.006
Master.

30:56.030 --> 30:57.566
You also want to set up the external game?

30:57.590 --> 30:59.040
Yes.

30:59.150 --> 31:00.416
Tang's Gambling House

31:00.440 --> 31:01.946
and all its branches are going to do so.

31:01.970 --> 31:02.846
Master.

31:02.870 --> 31:04.320
Brilliant idea.

31:04.710 --> 31:06.936
There is only a certain number of gamblers in Nandu.

31:06.960 --> 31:09.246
If you set up external games in all your gambling houses,

31:09.270 --> 31:12.046
gamblers will have more options.

31:12.070 --> 31:13.046
In this way,

31:13.070 --> 31:15.606
Liansheng House won't make much money.

31:15.630 --> 31:18.526
What's wrong with Yun Xiang?

31:18.550 --> 31:19.516
I admit

31:19.540 --> 31:21.086
he's quite resourceful.

31:21.110 --> 31:23.876
But the key to winning this competition is wealth.

31:23.900 --> 31:24.696
Right?

31:24.720 --> 31:27.170
With how little money he has,

31:27.600 --> 31:29.156
he can't achieve anything

31:29.180 --> 31:30.516
no matter how smart he is.

31:30.540 --> 31:31.676
That's right.

31:31.700 --> 31:33.150
Do it!

31:33.690 --> 31:36.530
There are so many plants in our yard.

31:36.660 --> 31:40.330
But you favor this one.

31:54.780 --> 31:55.766
Miss,

31:55.790 --> 31:58.510
I can do it in person.

31:58.660 --> 32:01.150
I'll make sure no one knows.

32:04.180 --> 32:05.246
Rong,

32:05.270 --> 32:06.846
you made the promise

32:06.870 --> 32:08.366
when you were dying.

32:08.390 --> 32:11.060
You promised that if you could survive,

32:11.170 --> 32:13.226
you would hang it up

32:13.250 --> 32:15.370
and would never hurt anyone again.

32:17.640 --> 32:19.090
I remember.

32:20.110 --> 32:21.560
Of course I remember.

32:23.250 --> 32:26.046
Even if we put aside Tang Xiao,

32:26.070 --> 32:28.600
in order to protect Mingyu,

32:28.870 --> 32:30.550
it's nothing

32:31.530 --> 32:32.980
if I break my promise.

32:33.140 --> 32:36.756
But now Tang Xiao is confronting Yun Xiang.

32:36.780 --> 32:39.206
They are fighting with wisdom but not violence.

32:39.230 --> 32:40.780
What's wrong with that?

32:44.430 --> 32:46.766
But there's one thing I don't understand.

32:46.790 --> 32:50.590
Why did Yun Xiang choose to compete

32:50.740 --> 32:52.626
with Tang's Gambling House on revenues?

32:52.650 --> 32:55.426
This is clearly against the common sense of business.

32:55.450 --> 32:59.046
He used the Tang family to take down Qi Tianfeng.

32:59.070 --> 33:02.070
And now he's confronting Tang Xiao aggressively.

33:02.150 --> 33:06.850
His enemies are the biggest merchants in Nandu.

33:08.250 --> 33:10.400
If he wins again,

33:10.820 --> 33:14.150
what will he do next?

33:15.140 --> 33:17.060
He'll deal with the Su family.

33:46.410 --> 33:47.910
I give up.

33:49.490 --> 33:51.386
You're having fun.

33:51.410 --> 33:53.470
I have no one else to play go with.

33:54.060 --> 33:56.160
I can only kill time in this way.

33:56.190 --> 33:57.206
Do I dare to play go with you?

33:57.230 --> 33:59.246
I lost every time I played with you.

33:59.270 --> 34:00.990
I've learned my lesson.

34:03.280 --> 34:04.730
Here.

34:08.129 --> 34:09.386
When playing go,

34:09.410 --> 34:10.880
you can't retract your moves.

34:11.510 --> 34:13.446
First, don't be greedy.

34:13.470 --> 34:15.766
Second, don't rush blindly into the opponent's territory.

34:15.790 --> 34:17.826
Third, be well-prepared while attacking the other.

34:17.850 --> 34:20.156
Four, sacrifice to gain sente.

34:20.180 --> 34:22.890
Five, discard the small to save the big.

34:23.629 --> 34:26.070
Every move is very interesting.

34:34.170 --> 34:35.620
Why are you laughing?

34:36.609 --> 34:38.846
Things are chaotic

34:38.870 --> 34:40.666
and disorderly out there.

34:40.690 --> 34:43.576
The Tang and Su family and your Miss Shu

34:43.600 --> 34:45.755
are turning Liansheng House upside down.

34:45.779 --> 34:48.979
But you are having fun here.

34:53.460 --> 34:55.330
You consider this as chaotic?

34:57.630 --> 34:59.860
I want to make things worse.

35:38.120 --> 35:39.570
To suppress the poison.

35:48.870 --> 35:50.320
Master.

35:51.950 --> 35:53.400
Let me see.

35:54.100 --> 35:55.550
Does it hurt?

35:56.100 --> 35:58.226
You can like anyone you want.

35:58.250 --> 36:00.326
But you have to choose that rough.

36:00.350 --> 36:01.800
Have you learned your lesson?

36:05.910 --> 36:09.670
Yun Xiang is really a tough guy.

36:09.700 --> 36:12.276
He attracted people to bet on our competition.

36:12.300 --> 36:13.196
Well, I have to admit

36:13.220 --> 36:15.806
it's a good way to increase the revenue.

36:15.830 --> 36:18.670
Master, will you lose?

36:19.820 --> 36:21.670
What do you think, Tianhu?

36:24.430 --> 36:26.920
Liansheng House stayed open last night.

36:28.670 --> 36:32.670
They aren't lagging behind too much.

36:34.050 --> 36:35.500
Come on.

36:36.220 --> 36:37.950
You're so cute.

36:39.150 --> 36:41.540
Speaking of Ke Menglan,

36:41.540 --> 36:43.900
as she keeps an eye on you every day,

36:44.390 --> 36:46.270
how did you manage to come here?

36:48.030 --> 36:49.556
You are my master.

36:49.580 --> 36:51.560
I should be by your side.

36:56.770 --> 36:58.350
It would be nice if she

36:58.500 --> 37:00.806
can be half as sweet as you.

37:00.830 --> 37:04.350
Miss Ke obeys your orders.

37:04.710 --> 37:06.846
But why is she helping Liansheng House?

37:06.870 --> 37:08.320
I also want to know why.

37:09.440 --> 37:12.206
Ask her for me

37:12.230 --> 37:15.746
if she still wants her Elevation Certificate.

37:15.770 --> 37:16.696
If she doesn't want it,

37:16.720 --> 37:18.006
I'll burn it

37:18.030 --> 37:19.670
since I don't need it anyway.

37:20.150 --> 37:22.990
She wants it.

37:27.220 --> 37:28.670
Come back.

37:33.390 --> 37:36.326
After you go back, check on Yun Xiang for me.

37:36.350 --> 37:38.230
Since the third round started,

37:38.230 --> 37:40.206
he's been hiding in his room.

37:40.230 --> 37:43.286
Go and check if he's in his room

37:43.310 --> 37:46.066
and if he is, what he's doing.

37:46.090 --> 37:48.776
Master, please teach me what to say

37:48.800 --> 37:50.250
and what to do.

38:07.510 --> 38:08.960
You may leave.

38:11.270 --> 38:12.476
What's wrong?

38:12.500 --> 38:14.236
Tang Xiao imitated us

38:14.260 --> 38:15.746
and ordered all his gambling houses

38:15.770 --> 38:17.470
to set up external games.

38:17.730 --> 38:19.180
Then,

38:19.350 --> 38:20.550
fewer players

38:20.550 --> 38:22.090
will place their bets here.

38:24.710 --> 38:27.220
You stayed up all night. Go back and rest.

38:27.350 --> 38:28.726
The competition is so fierce.

38:28.750 --> 38:30.236
In such a situation,

38:30.260 --> 38:31.396
how can I sleep?

38:31.420 --> 38:34.390
It is at this crucial moment that you can't be flustered.

38:34.710 --> 38:35.626
Go and have a rest.

38:35.650 --> 38:37.100
I'll take care of this.

39:04.870 --> 39:06.320
Tianhu.

39:10.350 --> 39:11.486
Didn't I tell you

39:11.510 --> 39:13.190
not to disturb Mr. Yun?

39:14.430 --> 39:15.880
Miss Shu.

39:15.990 --> 39:17.996
The cook just made some soup.

39:18.020 --> 39:20.490
I thought Mr. Yun would like it.

39:27.790 --> 39:29.270
Did you really injure your face

39:29.870 --> 39:31.630
because you fell down?

39:32.570 --> 39:35.250
Yes, I wasn't paying attention while walking.

39:36.940 --> 39:38.880
Is Mr. Yun inside?

39:39.210 --> 39:40.920
Is that what you should ask?

39:41.210 --> 39:42.690
Don't you know the rules?

39:43.680 --> 39:45.250
What are the rules?

39:45.710 --> 39:47.066
To help Mr. Yun win,

39:47.090 --> 39:49.210
Liansheng House has changed the rules several times.

39:49.280 --> 39:51.080
We also set up external games.

39:51.330 --> 39:53.466
We are losing money. This is so ridiculous.

39:53.490 --> 39:55.126
If Mr. Yun had run away,

39:55.150 --> 39:56.346
who would take care of the mess?

39:56.370 --> 39:57.820
Tianhu.

40:01.910 --> 40:03.540
How rude!

40:04.750 --> 40:06.310
Apologize to Miss Shu.

40:08.950 --> 40:11.270
Miss Shu, I'm sorry.

40:12.670 --> 40:14.006
Miss Shu.

40:14.030 --> 40:16.606
We've been very busy these days.

40:16.630 --> 40:19.230
It's inevitable that we'll make some mistakes.

40:19.430 --> 40:20.990
Please forgive us.

40:21.030 --> 40:22.790
I will discipline her.

40:25.830 --> 40:27.280
Let's go.

40:36.260 --> 40:37.846
What happened?

40:37.870 --> 40:39.580
When did you switch to Tang Xiao's side?

40:40.400 --> 40:41.850
Miss,

40:43.070 --> 40:45.120
you are really a bitch.

40:45.350 --> 40:47.750
You are also on Master's side

40:48.240 --> 40:50.810
but you always help Liansheng House.

40:54.600 --> 40:56.760
This is not something you would say.

41:01.150 --> 41:02.600
Tell me.

41:03.450 --> 41:05.290
Is Tang Xiao forcing you?

41:10.370 --> 41:12.440
Is he threatening you with Jin's life?

41:13.350 --> 41:14.800
Tianhu.

41:15.640 --> 41:17.430
Tang Xiao kidnapped Jin

41:18.430 --> 41:21.170
to threaten Mr. Yun.

41:21.960 --> 41:23.466
As long as Mr. Yun wins,

41:23.490 --> 41:25.336
he will find a way to save Jin.

41:25.360 --> 41:26.810
Understand?

41:27.190 --> 41:29.540
Master won't hurt Jin.

41:30.470 --> 41:32.280
Master also said

41:32.950 --> 41:35.030
he would make Jin marry me

41:36.890 --> 41:39.010
if he could win Yun Xiang.

41:42.770 --> 41:44.190
Stop calling him Master.

41:44.210 --> 41:46.020
Master wanted me to ask you

41:46.240 --> 41:52.486
if you want the Elevation Certificate or not.

41:52.510 --> 41:53.960
You...

41:58.160 --> 42:00.360
You want the benefits of both sides.

42:00.750 --> 42:02.550
How despicable!

42:03.480 --> 42:04.930
You...

42:19.870 --> 42:21.590
I see.

42:26.740 --> 42:33.050
It looks like Master can burn the certificate.

42:47.650 --> 42:49.100
Tianhu.

42:50.780 --> 42:52.840
Tianhu. Tianhu.

43:12.320 --> 43:13.830
You're poisoned.

43:17.870 --> 43:19.320
Poisoned?

43:20.670 --> 43:22.360
You must be kidding.

43:23.510 --> 43:26.246
Master found out that I have an incurable disease.

43:26.270 --> 43:28.850
I must take his medicine every day to stay alive.

43:30.950 --> 43:32.670
Master also said

43:34.170 --> 43:38.290
if he loses this round, he won't give me any more medicine.

43:40.210 --> 43:41.660
Miss.

43:42.150 --> 43:43.710
If I die,

43:44.170 --> 43:45.890
bury me.

43:48.270 --> 43:49.720
Don't talk nonsense.

43:49.930 --> 43:51.750
I won't let you die.

43:52.700 --> 43:54.580
I won't let you die.

43:57.300 --> 43:59.710
Then, let's help Master, okay?

44:00.230 --> 44:02.620
Let's help him win this game.

44:03.390 --> 44:05.280
So that Master can win,

44:06.490 --> 44:08.310
and you can be elevated out of lowly status.
